少算了由加速前速度比得到的追及差。","D":"不符合第一次追及时甲乙路程差。"},"originTask":{"verified":true,"statement":"一条圆形跑道长 500 米，甲、乙两人从不同起点同时出发，均沿顺时针方向匀速跑步。已知甲跑了 600 米后第一次追上乙，此后甲加速 20% 继续前进，又跑了 1200 米后第二次追上乙。问甲出发后多少米第一次到达乙的出发点？","evidence":"题干、选项、答案和解析结构完整；原块按字节绑定，独立数值复核待本批回执。来源年份未认证，保持legacy-unverified。"},"reviewVerified":false,"resourceType":"question","prompt":"一条圆形跑道长 500 米，甲、乙两人从不同起点同时出发，均沿顺时针方向匀速跑步。已知甲跑了 600 米后第一次追上乙，此后甲加速 20% 继续前进，又跑了 1200 米后第二次追上乙。问甲出发后多少米第一次到达乙的出发点？","options":[{"key":"A","text":"180"},{"key":"B","text":"150"},{"key":"C","text":"120"},{"key":"D","text":"100"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"从第一次追及点重新看第二次追及：甲加速后跑 1200 米，快者比慢者多跑 1 圈，所以乙跑 1200-500=700 米，加速后甲乙速度比为 1200:700=12:7。甲加速 20%，则加速前甲乙速度比为 10:7。第一次追上前甲跑 600 米，乙跑 600×7/10=420 米，甲比乙多跑 180 米，即甲出发点到乙出发点的顺时针距离，选 A。","originalExampleFingerprint":"753148d4","declaredOriginalSource":"2020 国考","answerSourceKeys":["[\"quantity\",\"travel-core\",\"真题示例\"]"],"semanticAdmission":{"questionBinding":{"questionId":"notes-q-app-qu05-000113","questionRevision":1,"effectiveContentDigest":"9e39d7426cdfbc7907fcfa5515eb2ea7289d9ecee49b7ce57a1158f1bdb51ab7"},"resolvedDependencyManifest":{"primaryTargets":[{"id":"notes-target-app-qu05-000113","revision":1,"sha256":"68120bdb183d21a67e263c753ed620bb9578fb24f8a8721f2f62f9bc10fb144b"}],"supportingTargets":[],"knowledgeAtoms":[],"comparisonGroups":[],"sourceBindings":[{"subjectId":"quantity","pointId":"travel-core","tabId":"真题示例","revision":null,"sha256":"bac205d93d354b64a7c80399d36a20003a64797e644aab5864dbc2448196f468"},{"subjectId":"quantity","pointId":"travel-core","tabId":"knowledge","revision":null,"sha256":"d938b472b10a87fb39a61ff222f32816c6086b040010252a6b05afd4cfb1a7c4"}],"sourceAnchors":[],"originalExample":{"subjectId":"quantity","pointId":"travel-core","tabId":"真题示例","expectedBlockSha256":"c040e2c5ac2a0e21839605345eff51f767dbf30bf07044a750a9b35adda272fc","revision":null},"materialGroup":null,"images":[],"sharedSourceBindings":[]},"dependencyDigest":"c31baa6653d04902f470fdf700c10f7848e79a